## Analysis Structure

Reusable code lives in `src/{{project_slug}}/`. Notebooks and scripts import from there.

### Profiling

- `poe profile <script.py>` — CPU profiling via pyinstrument (HTML report, good for iterating)
- `poe profile-all <script.py>` — CPU + memory via scalene (use when memory is suspect)

